            <h1>&ldquo;Come Out of Her,<br><em>My People&rdquo;</em></h1>
            <div class="book-meta">
              <span class="book-meta-item"><strong>Year:</strong> 1843</span>
              <span class="book-meta-item"><strong>Author:</strong> Charles Fitch</span>
              <span class="book-meta-item"><strong>Format:</strong> Sermon Tract / PDF</span>
